{"overview":"وقایع فیلم در دهه 1980 در شهر تهران جریان دارد. فیلم ماجرای مادر جوانی به نام شیده (نرگس رشیدی) و دختر خردسال او درسا (آوین منشادی) می‌باشد که در غیاب پدر خانواده که پزشک جبهه جنگ است، خانه‌شان مورد تسخیر یک نیروی شیطانی قرار می‌گیرد و آنها را وحشت زده می‌کند...","tagline":"","overview_en":"After Shideh's building is hit by a missile during the Iran-Iraq War, a superstitious neighbor suggests that the missile was cursed and might be carrying malevolent Middle-Eastern spirits. She becomes convinced a supernatural force within the building is attempting to possess her daughter Dorsa, and she has no choice but to confront these forces if she is to save her daughter and herself.","tagline_en":"Fear will find you.","runtime":84,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["بابک انوری"],"countries":["JO","GB"],"cast":[{"name":"نرگس رشیدی","role":"Shideh","photo":"/fCh3rJkIKvvTfLQa8y1UClyNC3R.jpg"},{"name":"اوین منشادی","role":"Dorsa","photo":""},{"name":"بابی نادری","role":"Iraj","photo":"/3jfEwF7vyCTIDPPm2OFoFlEEVA0.jpg"},{"name":"Ray Haratian","role":"Mr. Ebrahimi","photo":"/1DcOx50pdS1xgybHBiDNBpkRFkz.jpg"},{"name":"حمید دجاوادان","role":"Mr. Fakur","photo":""},{"name":"Bijan Daneshmand","role":"Director","photo":"/6jDfUVoUSoNoVIsfybnkafp7GAp.jpg"},{"name":"Behi Djanati Atai","role":"Pargol","photo":"/quGKleiGd5fAUyu4sFA59XwEIEY.jpg"},{"name":"آرام قاسمی","role":"Mrs. Ebrahimi","photo":""},{"name":"سوسان فرروخنیا","role":"Mrs. Fakur","photo":""},{"name":"آرش مرندی","role":"Dr. Reza","photo":"/2t0oSf4RHIiG2XlLqaSKBvMiRwx.jpg"},{"name":"Nabil Koni","role":"Mr. Bijari","photo":""},{"name":"Sajjad Delafrooz","role":"Secretary","photo":"/wjW1iMpcpcQxb4FXlYTXOTFv7Gc.jpg"}],"trailer":"G_ATX4C8Pmw","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/375012/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Netflix","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/rK1KljqmbvO9HQa1PBFLILWah72.png"},{"n":"Netflix Standard with Ads","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/eGUwOOIxcazwEBxqJpSN5sWEu6V.png"},{"n